   "tip": {
    "title": "Colour before the noun",
    "text": "Colour words go before the thing they describe and never change form: ନାଲି ଫୁଲ \"red flower\", ନାଲି ଫୁଲ ସବୁ \"red flowers\". To say \"it is blue\" you can use the colour alone (ଏଇଟା ନୀଳ) or add ରଙ୍ଗ, \"colour\" (ଏଇଟା ନୀଳ ରଙ୍ଗ)."
   }
